OL,3,GNEWSAIOPC calls for probe into 'Putney
OL,4,Apusher' arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police watchdog has said the
OL,7,FMetropolitan Police's professional
OL,8,Fstandards unit should investigate the
OL,9,Fforce's handling of a case after the
OL,10,Fdeath of a man suspected of being the
OL,11,F"Putney Pusher".
OL,13,FNicholas Brandram was found dead at his
OL,14,FLondon home on 15 September. His family
OL,15,Fsaid he took his own life after the
OL,16,F"immense pressure" of a police
OL,17,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
