OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIOPC calls for probe into 'Putney
OL,4,Apusher' arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 44-year-old was under suspicion of
OL,7,Fbeing the jogger who pushed a woman
OL,8,Finto the path of a bus during a run on
OL,9,FPutney Bridge in west London in May
OL,10,F2017.
OL,12,FThe Met police made a mandatory
OL,13,Freferral to the Independent Office for
OL,14,FPolice Conduct (IOPC) following the
OL,15,Fbanker's death.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
